<main class="sv-page" id="svApp">
<div class="sv-wrap">

<div class="sv-metrics"><div><small>Eligible Admin Vouchers</small><strong id="svAdminCount">—</strong><span>Platform-issued offers</span></div><div><small>My Shop Vouchers</small><strong id="svShopCount">—</strong><span>Created for your products</span></div><div><small>Active Shop Vouchers</small><strong id="svActiveCount">—</strong><span>Currently valid &amp; enabled</span></div><div><small>Total Voucher Allocation</small><strong id="svAllocationCount">—</strong><span>First come, first served</span></div></div>
<section class="sv-shell"><nav class="sv-tabs" aria-label="Voucher categories"><button class="active" type="button" data-tab="admin">Admin Vouchers <span id="svAdminTabCount"></span></button><button type="button" data-tab="mine">My Shop Vouchers <span id="svMineTabCount"></span></button></nav>
<div class="sv-panel" data-panel="admin"><div class="sv-panel-head"><div><h2>Available ShopEase Admin Vouchers</h2><p>Platform promos your shop can potentially accept when its products, category, buyers and delivery conditions qualify.</p></div><span class="sv-mini-badge">Managed by Admin</span></div><div class="sv-tools"><label class="sv-search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="m16 16 4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg><input type="search" id="svAdminSearch" placeholder="Search by voucher name or code"></label><select id="svAdminFilter" aria-label="Filter admin vouchers"><option value="all">All offers</option><option value="active">Currently active</option><option value="upcoming">Upcoming</option><option value="expired">Expired</option></select></div><div class="sv-grid" id="svAdminGrid"></div><div class="sv-empty" id="svAdminEmpty" hidden>No matching admin vouchers.</div></div>
<div class="sv-panel" data-panel="mine" hidden><div class="sv-panel-head"><div><h2>My Shop Vouchers</h2><p>Exclusive codes for products sold by your shop. Manage limits and publishing from here.</p></div><button type="button" class="sv-secondary" id="svCreateSecondary">＋ Create New</button></div><div class="sv-tools"><label class="sv-search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="m16 16 4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg><input type="search" id="svShopSearch" placeholder="Search my voucher code or title"></label><select id="svShopFilter" aria-label="Filter shop vouchers"><option value="all">All statuses</option><option value="active">Active</option><option value="upcoming">Upcoming</option><option value="expired">Expired</option><option value="paused">Paused</option><option value="exhausted">Fully claimed</option></select></div><div class="sv-grid" id="svShopGrid"></div><div class="sv-empty" id="svShopEmpty" hidden>No shop vouchers match these filters. Select Create Voucher to add one.</div></div>
</section></div></main>
<div class="sv-overlay" id="svDetailsOverlay" hidden aria-hidden="true"><section class="sv-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="svDetailsTitle" tabindex="-1"><header class="sv-dialog-top"><span>VOUCHER DETAILS</span><button class="sv-x" type="button" data-close aria-label="Close">×</button></header><div class="sv-hero"><span class="sv-ticket">▣</span><div><strong id="svDetailsValue"></strong><p id="svDetailsSubtitle"></p></div><span class="sv-hero-pill" id="svDetailsStatus"></span></div><div class="sv-dialog-body"><h2 id="svDetailsTitle"></h2><p class="sv-muted" id="svDetailsPurpose"></p><div class="sv-detail-grid" id="svDetailsGrid"></div><section class="sv-terms"><h3>Terms &amp; Conditions</h3><ul id="svDetailsTerms"></ul></section><div class="sv-cod"><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD) only</strong><span>Discounts apply only when all checkout eligibility rules and the remaining redemption quota are satisfied.</span></div></div><footer class="sv-dialog-actions"><button type="button" class="sv-secondary" data-close>Close</button><button type="button" class="sv-primary" id="svDetailsToggle" hidden></button></footer></section></div>
<div class="sv-overlay" id="svCreateOverlay" hidden aria-hidden="true"><section class="sv-dialog sv-create-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="svCreateTitle" tabindex="-1"><header class="sv-dialog-top"><span>SHOP VOUCHER SETUP</span><button type="button" class="sv-x" data-close aria-label="Close">×</button></header><div class="sv-form-heading"><h2 id="svCreateTitle">Create a Shop Voucher</h2><p>Set the promo rules, eligible items and first-come-first-served allocation for buyers.</p></div><form id="svVoucherForm" novalidate><div class="sv-form-body"><div class="sv-form-section"><h3>Voucher Information</h3><div class="sv-form-grid"><label class="sv-field sv-span2"><span class="sv-field-label">Voucher Title <em>*</em></span><input name="title" maxlength="65" required placeholder="e.g. Weekend Shop Savings"></label><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Voucher Code <em>*</em></span><input name="code" maxlength="20" minlength="4" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,20}" required placeholder="e.g. SHOPWEEKEND15"><small>4–20 letters/numbers, underscores or hyphens; unique for your shop.</small></label><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Discount Type <em>*</em></span><select name="discountType" required><option value="percent">Percentage (%)</option><option value="fixed">Fixed Amount (₱)</option></select></label><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Discount Value <em>*</em></span><input type="number" name="discountValue" min="0.01" step="0.01" required placeholder="e.g. 15"></label><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Minimum Spend (₱) <em>*</em></span><input type="number" name="minimumSpend" min="0" step="0.01" required placeholder="e.g. 500"></label><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Maximum Discount (₱) <em>*</em></span><input type="number" name="maximumDiscount" min="0.01" step="0.01" required placeholder="e.g. 200"><small>For percentage discounts, this caps the peso discount.</small></label></div></div>
<div class="sv-form-section"><h3>Eligibility &amp; Stacking</h3><div class="sv-form-grid"><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Eligible Items <em>*</em></span><select name="eligibleItems" id="svEligibleItems"><option value="all">All products in my shop</option><option value="selected">Selected shop products</option></select></label><label class="sv-field" id="svProductField" hidden><span class="sv-field-label">Eligible Product IDs or SKUs <em>*</em></span><textarea name="productIds" rows="2" placeholder="e.g. SKU-001, SKU-002"></textarea><small>Comma-separated product IDs or SKUs from your shop.</small></label><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Eligible Buyers <em>*</em></span><select name="eligibleBuyers"><option value="all">All buyers</option><option value="first">First-time buyers at my shop</option><option value="returning">Returning buyers</option></select></label><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Voucher Stacking <em>*</em></span><select name="stacking"><option value="none">Cannot combine with other vouchers</option><option value="shipping">Can combine with shipping voucher only</option></select></label></div></div>
<div class="sv-form-section"><h3>Allocation &amp; Redemption</h3><div class="sv-form-grid"><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Total Vouchers to Release <em>*</em></span><input type="number" name="quantity" min="1" max="100000" step="1" required placeholder="e.g. 100"><small>Only this many successful claims can use the voucher.</small></label><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Uses Per Buyer <em>*</em></span><input type="number" name="perBuyer" min="1" max="100000" step="1" value="1" required><small>Each buyer may use up to this many.</small></label></div></div>
<div class="sv-form-section"><h3>Validity &amp; Publishing</h3><div class="sv-form-grid"><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Start Date &amp; Time <em>*</em></span><input type="datetime-local" name="starts" required></label><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">End Date &amp; Time <em>*</em></span><input type="datetime-local" name="ends" required></label><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Initial Status <em>*</em></span><select name="enabled"><option value="true">Published (subject to validity)</option><option value="false">Draft / Paused</option></select></label><label class="sv-field"><span class="sv-field-label">Additional Terms (optional)</span><textarea name="terms" rows="3" maxlength="650" placeholder="Other conditions buyers should know"></textarea></label></div></div>
<p class="sv-error" id="svFormError" role="alert" hidden></p><div class="sv-form-hint">COD only · Store-specific vouchers · First come, first served · Buyers can redeem eligible codes during checkout.</div></div><footer class="sv-dialog-actions"><button type="button" class="sv-secondary" data-close>Cancel</button><button type="submit" class="sv-primary">Create Voucher</button></footer></form></section></div>
